      {
       "span": 6,
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "heading",
           "level": 2,
           "html": "<strong>Hello World!</strong>",
           "align": "center",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "<em>Award-winning transmedia universe of films, sculptures, AI characters, installations and books </em>",
           "align": "center",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "&nbsp;",
           "blank": true,
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "In a distant future, Little Martians are unique beings descended from all of Earth's life forms. Through AI-enhanced symbiosis, they have evolved to thrive in extreme environments, often protected by ceramic-like exoskeletons and capable of harnessing all sorts of environmental energy.&nbsp;",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "Each Little Martian embodies a distinct survival strategy and philosophical approach to existence. They’re immigrants, preparing the ground for complex life to evolve while preserving Earth's memories in the Imaginarium: a vast network of simulations of Earth's biological and cultural heritage.&nbsp;",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "Humans can only access a portion of this network, known as the Human Imaginarium, which functions like a bridge between human consciousness and the Little Martians' complex reality.&nbsp;",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "For Little Martians, life itself is sacred art. They are guardians and creators, ensuring that Earth's spark, in all its beautiful diversity, continues its journey through the cosmos.",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "spacer",
     "ar": null
    }
   ]
  },
